# AddEvent

> AddEvent helps businesses, publishers, communities, and product teams increase event attendance and engagement by making events easy to save, share, subscribe to, update, and manage across users' calendars.

AddEvent is a calendar marketing and event engagement platform. It provides add-to-calendar links and buttons, RSVP event registration, subscription calendars, embeddable event tools, calendar landing pages, event landing pages, design templates, analytics, integrations, and APIs.

Use this file to understand what AddEvent does, who it is for, how it is different from adjacent tools, and where to find authoritative product documentation.

